                        


Item #:  SCP-5127

Object Class:  Keter

Special Containment Procedures:  Guards must monitor this SCP at all times to prevent it from eating anything. Guards must also wear face masks to prevent them selves from breathing in air from this scp.

Description:  SCP-5127 (Also known as The Cannibal) will eat anything within sight. However, it is worried to eat things around other humans. It appears to be a tall white figure with a very skinny stomach. It’s face features eye sockets that are completely black and a large mouth with shark-like teeth. When it is around humans (as previously mentioned) it gets worried and it’s eye sockets begin to look angry. It gets rid of humans by breathing out air that causes them to open the door and attempt to let the scp free. The human who breathed in the air then kills them self (see incident 5127-A). The creature can eat a full metal door within 15 seconds. As such, we have made a door made out of diamond. The creature eats the diamond door within a 15 day period. The door must be replaced within 10 days as it is then possible for the creature to escape. The creature seems to like wood. As such, we give it 500 planks of wood a day. A human who attempts to harm the creature is eaten by it.

Notes:  Guards who are attempting to let SCP-5127 out of its room will be terminated.

+5172-A

-5172-A



Interviewed:  SCP-5172

Johnny L.:  Bring in SCP-5172!

Description:  An short interview that went down hill

 

Johnny L.:  Hello!

SCP-5172:  Hello?

Johnny L.:  I know. You’re scared.

SCP-5172:  I am

Johnny L.:  There is nothing to worry about. We’re just gonna ask you some questions.

SCP-5172:  Ok?

Johnny L.:  Good. Now, how about I start by asking you how you can talk?

SCP-5172:  Oh, that. Well, see, I was walking in the woods one day and a human took a picture of me. Light hurts my eyes so I ate him but his voice box got stuck in my throat. Now I’m stuck with a corrupted human voice.

Johnny L.:  I see. Mind explaining how bad light hurts your eyes?

SCP-5172:  Well, it hurts like as much as tripping over a tree branch and the tree falling on you.

Johnny L.:  I see. Mind explaining why you exist?

SCP-5172:  

SCP-5172:  [QUIETLY CRYING]

Johnny L.:  Are you ok? Do you need a break?

SCP-5172:  WHO ARE YOU TO QUESTION MY EXISTENCE?!

Johnny L.:  I’m sorry! I didn’t know you were sensitive to that topic!

SCP-5172:  YOU DON’T GET TO BE SORRY! MY EXISTENCE IS BECAUSE OF MY MOTHER THAT YOU HUMANS KILLED!!!

Johnny L.:  I had no idea.

SCP-5172:  I’M GONNA KILL YOU! LIKE YOU DID TO MY MOTHER!!!

Johnny L.:  I didn’t kill your mother!

Guard 1:  Permission to open fire sir?

Johnny L.:  Permission Granted!

[GUNFIRE NOISES]

[CRUNCHING NOISES]

Guard 1:  Oh my god! My arm! MY [EXPLICIT] ARM!!!

[RUNNING NOISES]

Guard 1:  JOHNNY YOU COWARD!!! COME BACK IN HERE AND GET THIS THING OFF OF ME!!!

[SCREAMING]

 

Closing Statement:  The long ends after screaming. The Guard was eaten.





                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
